      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Pro Tip**: Scatter these snippets strategically across different pages—Home, Services, Pricing, FAQ—and keep the messaging consistent to highlight the subscription benefits."
        }
      ]
